Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.99,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.27,0:01:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\NAll your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\NThat we're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.41,0:01:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.81,0:01:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The unrivaled pirate captain\Nwho was also the ship's cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what has any of\Nthis got to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been a pirate\Nfor many years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose the life of a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chose the life of a cook, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have a choice, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You live as a cook because the only\Nthing you can be now is a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was known far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Redfoot Seth was a master of deadly\Nkicks who never used his hands in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was said that with his\Nmighty legs he could crush
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bedrock to sand and leave\Nfootprints on solid steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Redfoot referred to his boots,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.27,0:02:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which became soaked in the blood of\Nhis enemies as he kicked them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it really is a pity that you no\Nlonger have that precious leg of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that rumor some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unlucky for you to have\Nsuch an accident at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that your greatest weapon has been\Nsacrificed to the sea, you're defenseless,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,completely unable to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a cook, and as long as I have my\Ntwo hands for that, I'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Redfoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the man who sold\Nthe perilous waters
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.71,0:03:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Grand Line and came back unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There should be a logbook detailing your\Ntactics, a full year of your journey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it to me, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.81,0:03:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is he saying you've been\Nto the Grand Line too, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My logbook, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do indeed have a record of my travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I will never hand it over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ignorant brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That logbook is sacred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the pride of the\Ncrew that I sailed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's far too important to give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true that\Nthe Grand Line beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I will never give up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Don Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, it's just another ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had enough weapons,\Nand men, and ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, the only thing\NI lacked was information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just didn't know enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I'll fix all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I have your logbook,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll form another pirate fleet\Nand seize the legendary One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I will stand as ruler\Nof this great pirate era!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.20,0:04:46.16,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(685,727,\1a&H00&)}The Oath
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.20,0:04:46.16,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Oath
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me who's gonna be\NKing of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better back off, Chopper! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not from this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't allow that kind of\Nstupidity again! Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, stupid or not, I'm just\Nstating the facts like they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna conquer the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.69,0:05:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that we didn't have\Nthe information we needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my fleet of 5,000 men was wiped\Nout in just seven days, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sea is hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? One week?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dawn Creek's ships were\Nwiped out in seven days?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't find your\Nsmart-ass remarks very amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist on this foolish behavior,\NI'll crush you right here and right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure to send you\Nto an early grave, you cocky runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.83,0:06:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't need help, that's okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appreciate the offer, but I\Nthink I can handle this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those two guys your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty small\Ngroup you got there, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.81,0:06:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a part of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm going to go feed my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those of you who don't\Nwish to die can leave
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.91,0:06:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the restaurant now and escape that fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only things I'm after are\Nthe logbook and this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However if you wish to\Nstay and be slaughtered I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have no problem burying\Nevery last one of you at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:06:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought it would be this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to apologize for, sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every cook at this restaurant\Ndid what they thought was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to\Nsay about that. But boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you acting as if\Nyou're taking Sanji's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This mess is his fault! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji is responsible for\Nthis whole damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.15,0:07:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, boss, that man's gonna put your\Nprecious restaurant out of business!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools don't know what\Nyou're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of you have any idea what it's\Nlike to be on the brink of starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To have no food or\Nwater on the open ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way you could possibly understand\Nwhat a terrifying prospect that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the most difficult\Nsituation a man could ever face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:07:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're\Ntalking about, Chef Zef.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all you're gonna do is\Nstand around grumbling,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then leave this place and never come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, for one, am gonna stay and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't live with myself if I\Naccepted defeat! I'm staying, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.79,0:08:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, this is our\Nrestaurant, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and this\Nplace is all I've got, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw how powerful Dawn is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ginny, listen up, because\NI'm only going to say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feeding someone who's hungry\Nis my sacred moral duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that your crew is well fed,\NI have no obligation to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a clean conscience, I can beat\Nevery last one of them to a bloody pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.85,0:08:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone tries to take the\Nrestaurant, they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them without\Na moment's hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real headcase, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting him live, then\Nthreatening to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can it cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's awesome, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares how awesome he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy there, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Don Krieg, but\Nhe's in pretty sad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ginny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you didn't know\Nanything about the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I thought you'd been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes any sense now. What\Nhappened to us on the seventh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day of our journey through that\Ncursed sea I don't know if it was a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dream or reality I saw things that\NI can't bring myself to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know in my heart that it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,impossible for that entire 50 ship fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be completely\Neradicated by a single man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as this man appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he began to systematically sink\Nour ships one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that raging storm hadn't\Ncome upon us when it did,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that monster would have\Ndestroyed our flagship as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if a single\Nother ship made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all seems like a terrible\Nnightmare burned into my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes, they were like a\Nhawk's, sharp and murderous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His gaze alone felt like\Nthe cold hand of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, that can only be\Nthe one known as Hawkeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your description of his heartless gaze isn't\Nproof of his identity in and of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the way he so easily decimated your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fleet confirms without\Na doubt that it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye, Mihawk
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you know him, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, i do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the man i've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that man have had some kind\Nof score to settle with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't do anything to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you disturbed him during a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he destroy an entire\Nfleet for something so trivial?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might like a little friendly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,advice on what kind of a\Nplace the Grand Line is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what kind of place is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably means that\Nanything can happen there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, do we really,\Nreally have to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.03,0:12:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be such a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand the concept of danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, my life's goal will be\Nachieved on the Grand Line. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out there somewhere,\Nand I'm gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's idiots like you\Nguys that end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.47,0:12:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be true, but\Nlay off the name-calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I devoted my entire life to becoming\Nthe world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made my choice, so I'm the only\None who gets to call me stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.15,0:12:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it only seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:12:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do any of you maggots understand\Nthe current situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That enormous galleon moored\Nin front of our dear little
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,restaurant is none other\Nthan Don Creek's flagship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't we check back into\Nreality and deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! We're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire is finally over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sailed into the pirate\Ngraveyard, but we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.65,0:13:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm glad you all made it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I'll need a healthy crew\Nto go back to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:14:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why the long faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, why are we going back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are there any other objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First we need to take over\Nthat floating restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.27,0:14:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can abandon the wreck\Nwe're on before it falls apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just a bunch of prissy cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't take much to crush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The restaurant is ours, and I'll fight\Nto the death to keep it that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main ship, it was cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.65,0:15:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something sliced up the scallion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the anchor or we'll sink\Nalong with them! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami and the guys are still\Non our ship out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro! Big bro! Yosaku! Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.53,0:16:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to say\Nthis, but she's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and make sure to tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big sis Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's meant to be, I'll see them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She took all the treasure and sailed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami sailed off with the going Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a straight answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it all happened\Nin only a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter, Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, I don't really mean to pry it\Nor anything, but what you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it's nothing, really. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a big bounty pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.55,0:17:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Big Sis, I think you're aiming a\Nlittle too high going after Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding, that\Nguy's really bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was playing it cool and\Nlaying low for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.41,0:17:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, staying out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But these days, that maniac is\Ncausing all sorts of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of tough walking away from\Na 20 million berry bounty though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is so powerful\Nthat there's the slightest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tiniest chance that we\Ncould lose and we'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you guys mind turning around while I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,change into something\Nmore comfortable good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure I don't mind\Nchanging like right now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever met a\Nwoman who's that daring?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you say we turn\Naround and see if she's done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.79,0:18:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Eh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.75,0:18:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing business, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your heads, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a thief who only targets pirates,\Nand my next score is this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never said anything about\Nbeing a member of this crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just traveling with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I only spent a short\Ntime with Luffy and the gang,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to tell them that I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's truly meant to\Nbe, I'll see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.89,0:19:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be in so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only job was to look after the ship,\Nand you're making us fail miserably!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the story of how Big\NSmuggler took the ship. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just had to make\Na bad situation worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Heartless Thief kind\Nof gave us that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Going Merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where your boat is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have it moored to the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saru and Usopp don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take their ship and go get Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let her keep the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, that woman is way\Nmore trouble than she's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:20:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the only person I'll\Naccept as the ship's navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One high-maintenance\Ncaptain, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Usopp, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's ready for action, Big Bro Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably stick around here till I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get this thing settled\Nwith the restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The situation here could\Nget really bad really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.03,0:20:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship has been broken to splinters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there! It's that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who destroyed our fleet is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's... that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.53,0:21:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.69,0:21:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Psycho Fold is back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the man I've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye. Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.77,0:21:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's Mihawk.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.08,0:21:30.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)}"Hawk Eye" Mihawk\NThe Greatest Swordsman\Nin the World
Dialogue: 2,0:21:25.08,0:21:30.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\3c&HE7E7E7&\c&HE7E7E7&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}"Hawk Eye" Mihawk\NThe Greatest Swordsman\Nin the World
Dialogue: 3,0:21:25.08,0:21:30.00,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}"Hawk Eye" Mihawk\NThe Greatest Swordsman\Nin the World
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.27,0:21:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to be the guy\Nwho destroyed Krieg's fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sunk 50 pirate ships out on\Nthe Grand Line all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he came back to finish\Nthe job, but is that all he wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.73,0:21:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just looks like any ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even appear to have any\Nkind of special weapons with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He carries his weapon on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.15,0:21:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:22:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have destroyed a galleon\Nlike that using nothing but a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye Mihawk is a true master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is without a doubt the\Ngreatest swordsman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell have we ever done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.85,0:22:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just killing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? I missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.43,0:22:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I aimed straight for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He diverted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He changed the course of the\Nbullets using the tip of his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.35,0:22:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.75,0:22:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.33,0:22:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a sword handled\Nso gently, but with such grace
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.51,0:22:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no strength in\Nswordplay based on force.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.95,0:22:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you also use that sword\Nto slice up this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.19,0:23:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.51,0:23:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.21,0:23:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.39,0:23:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got three swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be I set sail for\Nonly one reason to meet you and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.77,0:23:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your goal to beat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, how foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.77,0:23:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure were nice guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.97,0:23:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wonder, well, I wonder if\Nthey would let me join them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.15,0:23:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.87,0:23:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got spare time, so let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.41,0:24:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, no way! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.29,0:24:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rowan, Noah and Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.67,0:24:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Zoro of the Three\NSwords Style! It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.89,0:24:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.93,0:24:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.47,0:24:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy we better hurry come on\Nthe going mary is about to sell
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.23,0:24:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right out of sight Hey Luffy a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.63,0:24:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight you're a weak pitiful creature
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.13,0:24:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are in fact a competent\Nswordsman you should see the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.41,0:24:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disparity in our abilities. Even\Nbefore we cross swords, I must
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.15,0:24:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ask you why have you challenged\Nme could it be your courage or
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.61,0:24:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it simply your ignorance my
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.01,0:24:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ambition drives me also I made a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.79,0:24:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,promise I intend to keep the\NGreatest swordsman in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.31,0:24:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going up against robo no azoro\Ntwo masters of swordplay what kind
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.41,0:25:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of a fight is this gonna turn out\Nto be there isn't a person alive
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.33,0:25:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who can defeat Big Bro? He's\Nalready the best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.19,0:25:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.10,0:25:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ngonna do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.21,0:25:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be more than adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.01,0:25:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you wouldn't kill a\Nfly with a cannon, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.07,0:25:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have quite the\Nreputation on the East Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.97,0:25:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.27,0:25:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sea is by far the\Nweakest of the four.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.81,0:25:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't carry any\Nblades smaller than this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have had just about\Nenough of your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.05,0:25:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.07,0:25:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\Nbig the world really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.71,0:25:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onigiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.95,0:25:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.81,0:25:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saru!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.49,0:25:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.49,0:25:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro's onigiri was stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.61,0:25:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.87,0:26:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That attack never fails to stop an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.09,0:26:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.19,0:26:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move my swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.21,0:26:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What has he done?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.21,0:26:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's been able to defend\Nagainst that technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.99,0:26:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stopped it with a pocket knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.01,0:26:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.59,0:26:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be this much better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.19,0:26:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way our skills\Nare this far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.31,0:26:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not that far behind\Nthe world's strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.01,0:26:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just toying with them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.65,0:26:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight for real, Big Bro! Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.63,0:26:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be that much better than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.33,0:26:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such ferocious swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.29,0:27:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he defend against Zoro's\Nthree-sword style with such a small knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.31,0:27:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more of a monster with a\Nblade than even the Great Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not devote my entire\Nlife to swordsmanship
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.45,0:27:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be dispatched by a toy like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.31,0:27:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.81,0:27:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being born as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.75,0:27:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ever wanted was to be\Nthe world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.83,0:27:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.75,0:27:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me that someday one of us will\Nbe the world's greatest swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.13,0:27:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see who gets there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.79,0:27:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.11,0:27:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To become the world's strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.71,0:28:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ask that you let me have that sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.33,0:28:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get stronger than she ever was!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.89,0:28:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong enough that my name\Nreaches up to the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.71,0:28:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to be the\Nworld's greatest swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.43,0:28:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.37,0:28:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.03,0:28:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will defeat this man. For her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.33,0:28:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.83,0:28:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What weight do you carry\Nupon your shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.75,0:28:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak up, weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.37,0:28:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're deeply impressed by your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.67,0:28:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you let us join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.01,0:28:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the famed bounty\Nhunting duo that's fearsome
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough to silence a\Ncrying child by a hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.01,0:28:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yosaku and Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.23,0:28:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you call him weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.25,0:28:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.53,0:28:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.73,0:28:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Yosaku! Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.93,0:28:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.59,0:28:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay put!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.93,0:29:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.99,0:29:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.35,0:29:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,World's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.09,0:29:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.33,0:29:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates wouldn't have\Nany less than the best on his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.65,0:29:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.25,0:29:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are defeated yet you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.37,0:29:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,step back why not but i will not run
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.51,0:30:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I retreat a single step, I would\Nbe shattering the promises I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.97,0:30:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.03,0:30:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would lose my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.35,0:30:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, without that, there\Nwould be nothing left for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.81,0:30:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what defeat is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.63,0:30:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I won't accept defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.97,0:30:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.59,0:30:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.29,0:30:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strong heart indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.07,0:30:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He chooses death before defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.63,0:30:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, state your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.05,0:30:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Roronoa Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.03,0:30:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.27,0:30:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one as strong as you has\Ncome around in quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.09,0:30:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as a swordsman's courtesy,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use the world's strongest\Nblack sword to finish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.81,0:30:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.83,0:30:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.24,0:30:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.16,0:30:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the sword that sliced up the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.75,0:30:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.21,0:31:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will it be the world's strongest or death?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.35,0:31:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.98,0:31:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.41,0:31:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.71,0:31:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3,000 worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.15,0:31:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.79,0:31:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never in my life did I imagine I'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.81,0:31:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the power of\Nthe greatest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.47,0:31:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.01,0:31:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scars on the back are a swordsman's shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.17,0:31:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:32:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't rush\Nthese things, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.51,0:32:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.95,0:32:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be probable!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.81,0:32:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.81,0:32:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.59,0:32:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I devoted my entire life to becoming\Nthe world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.53,0:32:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my choice, so I'm the only\None who gets to call me stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.03,0:32:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.53,0:32:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His opponent was way out of his league.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.99,0:32:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How this fight would end\Nwas clear from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.59,0:32:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why choose death?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.03,0:32:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.57,0:32:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up your ambition and live!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.57,0:32:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the power of the\NGrand Line. It's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirate hunter Zoro was as\Nhelpless as a newborn baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.99,0:32:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.87,0:32:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:32:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be some kind of freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.27,0:33:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that loudmouthed little twerp\Nhas the power of a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.77,0:33:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you that young swordsman's comrade?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.53,0:33:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed with you\Nfor not interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.53,0:33:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be upset about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.67,0:33:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.17,0:33:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro, say something, please! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.81,0:33:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.09,0:33:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's hurry up and\Nget him out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.47,0:33:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got some medicine. Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.63,0:33:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still too early for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.43,0:33:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Hawkeye Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.53,0:33:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong, but there\Nis much for you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.27,0:33:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how many years it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.87,0:33:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will hold this title as the greatest\Nin the world and wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.63,0:33:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until that day, you must hone your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.79,0:33:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, seek me out, Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.57,0:33:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please say something! Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.29,0:34:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just anyone can earn the\Nregard of Hawkeye Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.27,0:34:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.25,0:34:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.07,0:34:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.93,0:34:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ambitions are even\Nloftier than your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.09,0:34:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.49,0:34:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you just\Nlet me worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.01,0:34:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.75,0:34:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was just unconscious. Big Ro!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.77,0:34:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're alive, then say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.29,0:34:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.81,0:34:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Ro!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.79,0:34:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.39,0:34:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.15,0:34:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.31,0:34:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for disappointing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.29,0:34:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you need nothing less than\Nthe greatest swordsman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.41,0:34:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.47,0:34:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.59,0:34:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stop saying things now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.97,0:34:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.03,0:34:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I solemnly swear, from this moment\Nforward, that I will never lose again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.39,0:35:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until the day comes when I\Ndefeat him and take his title!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.69,0:35:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never, never be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.57,0:35:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that okay, King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.99,0:35:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.31,0:35:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.85,0:35:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope to see you again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.01,0:35:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hawkeye!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.35,0:35:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression that\Nyou had come here to take my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.99,0:35:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you here to kill Don\NKrieg, ruler of the East Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.75,0:35:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought had crossed my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.89,0:35:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've had enough fun for today,\Nso I'm going home to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.95,0:35:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.75,0:35:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't even gotten started.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.59,0:35:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, but, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.75,0:35:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not a good idea\Nto try to keep him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.67,0:35:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.73,0:35:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just won't learn, will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.51,0:36:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddamn, he escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.95,0:36:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.86,0:36:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.11,0:36:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave Nami to you! Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.69,0:36:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.17,0:36:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro and I are gonna get her right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make sure you get that\Ncook to join our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.51,0:36:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, on the Going Merry, the five\Nof us will set sail to the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.09,0:36:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.03,0:36:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.97,0:36:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ran into a little distraction from\Nour plan, but the real fight starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.41,0:36:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take that ship! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.27,0:36:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.31,0:36:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I stop doing these chores if\NI get those pirates out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.77,0:36:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.97,0:37:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.45,0:37:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.45,0:37:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.53,0:37:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.25,0:37:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.97,0:37:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.47,0:37:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.99,0:37:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.75,0:37:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.03,0:37:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.15,0:37:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.23,0:37:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream. You

